<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>Chattr</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FAF6F1;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Your Chattr password was just changed.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FAF6F1;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E8DDD0;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2B2D42;">
<tr><td style="padding:28px 32px;background-color:#E8896B;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#E8896B 0%,#F0A978 55%,#3D5A80 100%);">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr>
<td width="56" style="width:56px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="width:56px;height:56px;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:18px;"><img src="cid:chattr-logo" width="42" height="42" alt="Chattr" style="display:block;margin:7px;border:0;"></td></tr></table></td>
<td style="padding-left:12px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#2B2D42;">Chattr</td>
<td align="right" style="font-size:14px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:18px 18px 5px 18px;padding:9px 14px;color:#2B2D42;">All set ✓</span></td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:36px 32px 8px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#2B2D42;">Your password was changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#2B2D42;">Hi <%= name %>, the password for your Chattr account was changed on <%= time %>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#2B2D42;">If this was you, there’s nothing else to do. If it wasn’t, reset your password right away.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><tr><td style="background:#E07A5F;border-radius:12px;"><a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#2B2D42;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;">Reset my password</a></td></tr></table>

</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 32px;border-top:1px solid #E8DDD0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#666A7E;">
<strong style="color:#2B2D42;">Chattr</strong> · Small talk, made cozy.<br>
This email was sent to <%= email %>.
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
